{
  "item": "Bow18",
  "mu_name": "Celestial Bow",
  "mu_name_from": "_enum.h:1586 MODEL_CELESTIAL_BOW = MODEL_BOW + 17, loaded from Item/Bow18.bmd (ZzzOpenData.cpp:698, one behind as every bow). Group 4 number 17 in OpenMU S6 Weapons.cs:233; WebZen's 1.00m item(Kor).txt carries the same row (docs/second-class-gear.md).",
  "why_this_one": "The Muse Elf's early bow, the Divine set's wave (docs/second-class-gear.md). Built first for the elf envoy in Atlans, who wears the Divine set, the Wings of Spirits and a second-class bow (the user, 2026-10-05: 'the seond elf has to wear muse set and 2nd wings and some 2nd class bow or crosbow'; Celestial Bow picked over the Great Reign Crossbow and the Arrow Viper Bow).",
  "profile": "weapon",
  "stats": {
    "from": "OpenMU S6 Weapons.cs:233. 0.75 and 0.95d have no second-class arms.",
    "call": "CreateWeapon(4, 17, 1, 24, 2, 4, true, \"Celestial Bow\", 92, 127, 155, 35, 76, 0, 0, 54, 198, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0)",
    "group": 4,
